/* ====================== BULLETIN BOARD COMPONENT =================== */
/* OurSpace embedded Bulletin — adapted from Bulletin Digital Junk Journal / Pinboard v1.1.
   Embedded mode is intentionally compact; fullscreen restores a full board workspace.
   All visual roles are driven by --bb-* design variables except the protected red fullscreen X. */
